    "2. **Weekly:** Wash bedding hot; damp-dust hard surfaces top to bottom.",
    "3. **Monthly:** Wash pillows/duvets; wipe baseboards, blinds, and vents; check the HVAC filter.",
    "4. **Continuously:** Hold humidity at 40–60%, keep clutter down, and let a probiotic surface treatment run in the background so surfaces rebuild slower.",
