  "quickAnswer": "To prevent mold naturally, control moisture first: fix leaks, keep indoor humidity below 60%, and ventilate damp rooms. Then clean existing spots with non-toxic options (soap and water, vinegar on hard surfaces) instead of bleach, and treat surfaces with an environmental probiotic so beneficial bacteria compete for the organic film mold needs to grow. Moisture control comes first, and everything else supports it.",
