    "For VOC-conscious households, the more relevant point is that a probiotic system produces no VOCs and no ozone of its own. Scented sprays, ozone generators, and fragranced \"air purifiers\" mask odors by adding more chemistry. If you're trying to lower your home's chemical load, a device that adds nothing is a feature. You can read the full [no VOCs and no ozone](/blog/are-environmental-probiotics-safe) profile, and how it ties into a healthier [indoor microbiome](/blog/indoor-microbiome-health), before deciding. A unit like the [Biotica 800](https://shop.envirobiotics.com/products/biotica-800) runs on that no-additives basis.",
    "## A natural VOC-reduction routine",
    "1. **When buying:** choose low-VOC / certified materials and solid wood where possible.",
