    "If you want a single figure to aim at rather than a range, **45–50%** is the practical target: comfortably inside the band with room to drift in either direction before anything goes wrong.",
    "## Too humid: above 60%",
    "High humidity is the more common problem in most climates and the one with the worse consequences, because mold and dust mites become active in this range.",
    "**What goes wrong:**",
